abstract: >-
  DuckRabbit is a typed, deterministic research-software package for generating
  and auditing visual, auditory, temporal, and audio-visual illusion stimuli.
  It provides reproducible parameters, canonical media buffers, physical
  measurements, provenance manifests, and publication-ready source artifacts.
message: If you use DuckRabbit, cite this project and the underlying illusion literature.
